[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0010","text":"────啊，辛苦了……！\n您来了啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0020","text":"……嗯\n辛苦了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0030","text":"是的！　────嗯，嘿咻……\n那个，在现场收到了好多零食什么的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0040","text":"这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0050","text":"……\n美琴小姐……吃不了这些吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0060","text":"……\n有喝的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0070","text":"喝的……如果是果冻的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0080","text":"啊，是，是的！\n喝的也有，果冻也有……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0082","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0090","text":"啊哈哈\n那，那个────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32500300_04_0100","text":"可以坐在……你旁边吗……！"}]
